WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-White House press secretary
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.771 align:start size:94% position:6%
has been holding a lot
of press briefings lately,

00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:06.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I don´t think all
the questions we need answered

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:08.274 align:start size:94% position:6%
have been asked,
so we decided to hold

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:09.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
another one
right here, right now.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:11.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s right --
Sarah Huckabee Sanders

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.512
and the "Late Night" press corps

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.414 align:start size:94% position:6%
are here in our studio
and ready to go.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
So without further ado,
it´s time

00:00:16.049 --> 00:00:19.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the "Late Night"
White House press briefing.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.321 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:26.593 align:start size:94% position:6%
♫♫

00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:29.496
Sarah. Sarah? Sarah? Sarah?

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:32.298 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sarah? Sarah, over here. Yes.
Sarah, thank you.

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
Seth Meyers,
"Late Night with Seth Meyers."

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:36.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
Secretary Sanders,
why do you think the country

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:40.006 align:start size:94% position:6%
is so frustrated
with the Trump presidency?

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.908
-It´s because
it should have ended yesterday.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:46.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yesterday. Great.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:48.715 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:50.417 --> 00:00:53.119
What do you consider to be
your main responsibility

00:00:53.119 --> 00:00:54.888
as White House press secretary?

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.589
-To create fake information.

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:58.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:01.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
What are the --
What are the five words

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:04.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
that scare Chief of Staff
John Kelly the most?

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:06.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The president
tweeted this morning.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What was President Trump
looking for

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:16.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
when he was putting together
his campaign staff?

00:01:16.376 --> 00:01:18.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Regular offenders
that have been

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:20.713
in massive amounts of trouble.

00:01:22.315 --> 00:01:23.850
-How is the White House staff

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:26.853
handling the new developments
in the Mueller investigation?

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.488
-They might start drinking.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.224
-Let´s say hypothetically

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:33.526 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Donald Trump
was offered an immunity deal,

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:34.894 size:84% position:42%
but in order to get it,

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:37.230
he had to incriminate his
two sons, Eric and Donald.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.865 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He´ll take it.

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:43.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What´s Trump trying to hide
with that long tie?

00:01:43.837 --> 00:01:46.172
-Probably a pretty big waist.

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:50.443
-So, today is Halloween,
and it seems the average IQ

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:52.479 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the White House
jumped several points.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:53.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
Why is that?

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:55.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We have some kids
with us here today.

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:59.819 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:04.424
-Is it true the White House

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
is putting Eric Trump up
for adoption?

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We´re not there yet.
We´re still in that process.

00:02:11.531 --> 00:02:13.233
-What do you say to Donald Trump

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.768 size:78% position:39%
to get him to show up
to cabinet meetings?

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:18.838
-There will be lots of fun
and I´m sure lots of candy.

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.909
-What does Donald Trump look for
in a spray tanner?

00:02:22.909 --> 00:02:24.978
-An enormous amount of coverage.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:28.581 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When does President Trump
change his pants?

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:31.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think that any time
there is leaking.

00:02:38.258 --> 00:02:41.728
-I heard Arby´s is looking
for a new slogan. Any ideas?

00:02:41.728 --> 00:02:43.663 size:75% position:38%
-All hat, no cattle.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:46.332 size:75% position:38%
-How´s Ivanka doing?

00:02:46.332 --> 00:02:47.867
-Tomorrow is her birthday.

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:50.370 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Actually, it was yesterday.
-I don´t care.

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:58.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What did Melania
give President Trump

00:02:58.611 --> 00:03:01.614
when she turned him down for sex
on election night?

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:03.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Inaugural balls.

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:12.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What would happen
if I shaved off my eyebrows?

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:15.228 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They will come back
stronger than ever before.

00:03:15.228 --> 00:03:16.829 size:88% position:44%
-I heard President Trump

00:03:16.829 --> 00:03:18.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
sat on the toilet this morning
without tweeting.

00:03:18.965 --> 00:03:20.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is another important
milestone.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, there you have it.
We´re out of time.

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:25.338
So, on behalf on the rest of the
press corps, have a good night.

